    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could personalize learning by adapting explanations to individual strengths/weaknesses, like my gaps from lower secondary education. They’d also demystify complex topics with step-by-step guidance, reducing anxiety. However, human interaction remains crucial for deeper understanding."
